                        "review": "I really wanted to play this game from the moment I saw it however I can't reccomend it.\n\nThe game lists itself as both standing and room scale.  I have a 5.5 wide by 8 foot long play space and couldn't play through shortly after starting the game because items were out of reach.\n\nI contacted the devs who asked me to send in-game phots, etc. and I never heard back even after contacting multiple times.\n\nThere have been no updates since November 2016.  It looks like this game has been left behind.  They talk about this being the precursor to a future full length game but at this point, I think I'll pass on that too.  I don't want to get burned twice.",
